{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Following that legendary style, Uchu Mega Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fighting action game</strong> in which aliens with <strong>dismembered bodies</strong> fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With familiar <strong>pixel art</strong> and <strong>simple controls</strong>, anyone can enjoy the fun of fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/0a71531b725fd901ea599fe0435e63f4.avif?t=1752607812\" width=108 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a <strong>power style</strong> that does not require combos, and a <strong>modern style</strong> that allows for one-button special moves. Beginners and fighting gamers can play together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited character participation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kyanta&quot; from &quot;Ultra Fight! Kyanta 2&quot; will be participating in the Steam version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/fc24d80ab36bf6111b0596bed8f06995.avif?t=1752607812\" width=238 height=374 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2503920?t=1752607812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/76f2b9f1e6406086ca5e90ae1419cc6ec003c4e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752607812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/913a81ed95f2d94676337836f4e87cd082c1c89b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752607812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/913a81ed95f2d94676337836f4e87cd082c1c89b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752607812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id